---
title: Carrot/Pineapple Cake
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Desserts
cook time: 35-40 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@flour{2%cups}
@baking soda{1.5%tsp}
@cinnamon{2%tsp}
@oil{1.5%cups}
@finely grated carrots{2%cups}
@chopped nuts{0.5%cup}
@drained, crushed pineapple{1%8.5-oz can}
@baking powder{2%tsp}
@salt{1.5%tsp}
@sugar{2%cups}
@eggs{4}
@flaked coconut{0.5%cup}

Bake in a 9x13 pan at 350 degrees for 35-40 minutes.
